Z||000000||Gold-86SE||11-08-2000||12:35 PM||||<BR>How many freeze plugs are on the block of the 2.5 4 banger?<P>I see three on the tranny side, three on the exhaust manifold side, and one above the timing gear cover, are there more?<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.txconnect.com/home/rharris/signature-a.jpg"> ||||reg||1
